| don't look weird?

00:12:53.038 --> 00:12:57.635
Okay, no prob. You look awesome!
Come on, just walk tall!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:00.188
Oh, Ran. You're late.

00:13:00.212 --> 00:13:02.146
Sorry about making you wait.

00:13:02.515 --> 00:13:04.426
Oh, pretty girl!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.129
In Japanese, that would be,
"shiny new, first year gal".

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:08.430
You look cute!

00:13:08.454 --> 00:13:10.684
It really looks good on you, Maki.

00:13:11.056 --> 00:13:13.602
No way! Maki? You don't mean...

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:15.403
The girl from yesterday?!

00:13:15.427 --> 00:13:18.158
Well, that is, good morning.

00:13:20.132 --> 00:13:21.009
How about it?

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:23.345
They're clothes from when
| was in junior high,

00:13:23.369 --> 00:13:25.714
but they're still pretty cool, don't you think?

00:13:25.738 --> 00:13:27.716
You even changed your hairstyle!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.217
But it looks really good!

00:13:29.241 --> 00:13:31.209
Maki? Is it really that Maki?

00:13:31.477 --> 00:13:34.139
I'm Tatsukichi. Nice to meetcha,
nice to meetcha!

00:13:34.613 --> 00:13:36.224
Nice to meet you too.

00:13:36.248 --> 00:13:39.309
Hey, Aya, where's Otohata?
| told you to invite him along.

00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:42.864
Well, he said he'd come
if he felt like it,

00:13:42.888 --> 00:13:45.066
but it looks like he isn't
coming after all.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.335
He sure isn't very sociable.

00:13:47.359 --> 00:13:49.271
Aya, you're not being aggressive
enough either.

00:13:49.295 --> 00:13:51.773
If you want him to come,
then you should just say so.

00:13:51.797 --> 00:13:54.376
It's not like I want him to...

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.245
Besides, I only called him because
you asked me to.

00:13:57.269 --> 00:13:58.580
| never said I wanted him to come.

00:13:58.604 --> 00:14:00.470
Maybe he's on a date with someone!

00:14:03.876 --> 00:14:08.490
Who Otohata dates has
nothing to do with me!

00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:10.458
Yeah, yeah, if you say so.

00:14:10.482 --> 00:14:12.109
It's true, okay?!

00:14:12.551 --> 00:14:14.229
All right.

00:14:14.253 --> 00:14:16.298
Ran, what are we doing now?

00:14:16.322 --> 00:14:20.088
Well, come on, today is Maki's
debut day as a gal!

00:14:20.459 --> 00:14:22.370
<i>Let's introduce her to Shibuya!</i>

00:14:22.394 --> 00:14:24.973
Come on, Maki, I told you
to stand tall, didn't I?!

00:14:24.997 --> 00:14:26.658
Yes, Ma'am!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.475
Ook!

00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:51.023
Ook!

00:14:53.859 --> 00:14:55.554
Ook!

00:15:00.699 --> 00:15:03.725
Wow, so you're Ran's disciple.

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:05.747
Yeah, something like that.

00:15:05.771 --> 00:15:09.230
So, if you're her disciple, are you
doing training to become a gal?

00:15:09.675 --> 00:15:11.871
Maki's a huge hit with the boys.

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:14.956
It looks like her debut in Shibuya
has been a great success.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:16.925
Hey, what's the matter, Ran?

00:15:16.949 --> 00:15:19.094
Oh, nothing.

00:15:19.118 --> 00:15:20.962
If you're Ran's first disciple,

00:15:20.986 --> 00:15:23.819
that makes you Shibuya's
number two gal, doesn't it?

00:15:24.556 --> 00:15:26.046
Number two?

00:15:28.394 --> 00:15:30.590
This is getting to be kind of incredible.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.820
Woo-hoo!

00:15:35.467 --> 00:15:37.178
What're you doing, Tatsukichi?

00:15:37.202 --> 00:15:39.261
Yay! Were you watching, Ran?

00:15:39.672 --> 00:15:42.717
| won the prize, a new CD!

00:15:42.741 --> 00:15:46.354
How about we go to the park now
and give Maki a para-para lecture?

00:15:46.378 --> 00:15:49.024
You just wanna dance, don't you?

00:15:49.048 --> 00:15:50.880
Not that that's bad.

00:15:51.717 --> 00:15:53.061
What?

00:15:53.085 --> 00:15:55.053
Hey, where'd Maki go?

00:15:56.121 --> 00:15:58.089
What? She was around here
just a minute ago.

00:15:58.691 --> 00:15:59.801
That's strange.

00:15:59.825 --> 00:16:01.793
What?!

00:16:03.929 --> 00:16:07.456
Number two in Shibuya... Number two!

00:16:09.034 --> 00:16:10.502
Hey, you!

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.113
What? Me?

00:16:12.137 --> 00:16:13.866
That's right, you!

00:16:14.239 --> 00:16:17.285
You've got some guts bumping
into me and then ignoring me!

00:16:17.309 --> 00:16:20.388
You picking a fight with us
knowing who we are?

00:16:20.412 --> 00:16:21.723
What? Who are you?

00:16:21.747 --> 00:16:25.615
What? You don't know who we are?
You must be an outsider.

00:16:26.151 --> 00:16:28.029
Outsider?

00:16:28.053 --> 00:16:28.763
No, I'm not!

00:16:28.787 --> 00:16:31.599
I'm the great Ran Kotobuki's
first disciple, Maki Komine!

00:16:31.623 --> 00:16:33.101
Miss Ran's disciple?

00:16:33.125 --> 00:16:34.235
That's right.

00:16:34.259 --> 00:16:37.839
Liar! I've never heard of Miss Ran
taking on a disciple!

00:16:37.863 --> 00:16:41.076
It's not a lie! I even got these
clothes from Miss Ran!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.711
What?

00:16:42.735 --> 00:16:45.363
Hey, if it's for real, it could
mean trouble. Let's go.

00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:48.162
You better watch it!

00:16:49.975 --> 00:16:53.775
Wow, those scary people ran away.

00:16:54.847 --> 00:16:57.192
| guess it's true that she's
Shibuya's number one gal.

00:16:57.216 --> 00:16:58.760
It's not a lie.

00:16:58.784 --> 00:17:00.395
Hey, hey, you there.

00:17:00.419 --> 00:17:03.320
You look bored. You wanna
come hang out with us?

00:17:05.424 --> 00:17:06.735
Oh, I know!

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:08.887
Say, do you know the great
Ran Kotobuki?

00:17:09.395 --> 00:17:11.339
Huh? Know her?

00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:14.060
There's no one in Shibuya who
doesn't know Miss Ran.

00:17:16.168 --> 00:17:17.727
Guess what?

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.581
What?! For real?!

00:17:19.605 --> 00:17:23.064
Okay, okay! In that case,
we'll show you around Shibuyal

00:17:26.078 --> 00:17:29.124
Oh! I was so close!

00:17:29.148 --> 00:17:31.893
Come on, why don't you
give up already, Maki?

00:17:31.917 --> 00:17:33.495
You want me to get it for you?

00:17:33.519 --> 00:17:35.487
No! Maki's going to get it!

00:17:37.156 --> 00:17:39.022
Oh, fine.

00:17:41.326 --> 00:17:43.405
There!

00:17:43.429 --> 00:17:45.940
Wait, is this your first time
playing billiards?

00:17:45.964 --> 00:17:48.943
Well, I guess it's my turn.
I'll show you how it's done.

00:17:48.967 --> 00:17:51.679
Oh, that didn't count.
So, can I do it over?

00:17:51.703 --> 00:17:53.348
What?! For real?!

00:17:53.372 --> 00:17:55.340
Come on, please!

00:17:56.341 --> 00:17:57.900
Sure, sure.

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:00.855
Curry rice, a hamburger,

00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:03.458
also a carbonara, and
a strawberry parfait!

00:18:03.482 --> 00:18:05.326
What?! You want all that?!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.828
You won't be able to eat all that.

00:18:06.852 --> 00:18:09.030
Don't worry, don't worry.
Maki's a growing girl.

00:18:09.054 --> 00:18:11.148
Oh, and a sirloin steak soup set too!

00:18:12.758 --> 00:18:14.736
Thank you for the food!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.604
Hey, what about the rest of it?

00:18:16.628 --> 00:18:18.528
Feel free to share it
amongst yourselves.

00:18:22.768 --> 00:18:26.014
What are you doing?! I'll tell Miss Ran!

00:18:26.038 --> 00:18:27.949
Go ahead, I dare you!

00:18:27.973 --> 00:18:30.305
You're Miss Ran's disciple,
so you'll introduce us to her?

00:18:30.676 --> 00:18:33.555
Damn it, you were just
BSing the whole time!

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:34.756
It wasn't a lie!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:37.010
Then take us to see her right now!

00:18:37.516 --> 00:18:39.484
You know where Miss Ran is, don't you?

00:18:39.985 --> 00:18:41.453
Well...

00:18:42.154 --> 00:18:44.566
You were going to make us
treat you left and right,

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.801
and then hightail it out of here when
things got hot, weren't you?

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:48.793
You sure played us for fools!

00:18:49.161 --> 00:18:50.972
You're going to pay for this!

00:18:50.996 --> 00:18:52.373
Hey.

00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:53.887
Oh, Miss Ran!

00:18:55.534 --> 00:18:57.679
Would you mind cutting her a break?

00:18:57.703 --> 00:18:59.671
What? Then, are you saying...

00:19:00.239 --> 00:19:03.300
Yeah, Maki's my honest
to goodness disciple.

00:19:03.709 --> 00:19:05.905
Even though she seems to have
caused a lot of trouble.

00:19:08.113 --> 00:19:12.560
Would you do me a favor
and overlook it for today?

00:19:12.584 --> 00:19:14.429
Sure, I understand.

00:19:14.453 --> 00:19:16.431
If that's what you want, Miss Ran.

00:19:16.455 --> 00:19:18.032
Well, we'll be going now.

00:19:18.056 --> 00:19:19.546
Excuse us!

00:19:23.862 --> 00:19:25.523
Maki...

00:19:26.865 --> 00:19:28.458
Hey, Maki!

00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:30.491
Maki!

00:19:39.845 --> 00:19:41.022
What'll I do?

00:19:41.046 --> 00:19:42.639
She hates me.

00:19:43.215 --> 00:19:45.513
Miss Ran hates me.

00:20:02.601 --> 00:20:04.069
What...

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:07.900
What am I doing here?

00:20:10.742 --> 00:20:12.437
Maki!

00:20:13.645 --> 00:20:15.170
Miss Ran?

00:20:22.554 --> 00:20:24.648
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:20:31.296 --> 00:20:33.663
Miss Ran?

00:20:35.901 --> 00:20:39.337
Sheesh, don't make me
worry so much, okay?

00:20:41.206 --> 00:20:43.607
Miss Ran?

00:20:50.282 --> 00:20:51.943
Maki...

00:20:52.551 --> 00:20:55.885
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry, Miss Ran!

00:20:56.722 --> 00:20:58.833
It's okay, don't sweat it.

00:20:58.857 --> 00:21:02.225
You got to become a gal and you
got a little carried is all, right?

00:21:03.462 --> 00:21:05.206
Why?

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:09.224
Why did you do all those fake
ironclad rules for gals?

00:21:09.768 --> 00:21:12.747
Oh, so you'd noticed. That's why.

00:21:12.771 --> 00:21:14.482
Please tell me.

00:21:14.506 --> 00:21:17.407
That's because you're my friend.

00:21:18.644 --> 00:21:21.055
You do everything you can
for your friends.

00:21:21.079 --> 00:21:24.174
Because that's a bona fide
ironclad rule for gals.

00:21:30.722 --> 00:21:34.335
Everyone, thank you so much
for everything!

00:21:34.359 --> 00:21:35.670
Take care.

00:21:35.694 --> 00:21:36.638
Bye-bye.

00:21:36.662 --> 00:21:39.140
You gotta come and visit us again, datchu.

00:21:39.164 --> 00:21:42.043
When you do, we'll have a para-para
match! So, count on it!

00:21:42.067 --> 00:21:44.312
Don't get lost next time, okay?

00:21:44.336 --> 00:21:47.431
Well, keep up the spirit, even
when you're back home!

00:21:48.173 --> 00:21:49.183
I will!

00:21:49.207 --> 00:21:50.766
Well, then.

00:21:55.447 --> 00:21:56.505
Help!

00:22:01.286 --> 00:22:03.755
Miss Ran, I had a thought.

00:22:04.389 --> 00:22:06.734
The reason you're a super gal is

00:22:06.758 --> 00:22:09.871
because your style and clothes
are cool, of course,

00:22:09.895 --> 00:22:13.229
but also because most importantly,
you're cool on the inside.

00:22:14.066 --> 00:22:16.878
| will work hard to become a gal
who's cool on the inside,

00:22:16.902 --> 00:22:21.567
so that I will really be worthy of
the clothes that you gave me!

00:22:22.374 --> 00:22:23.318
And when I do...

00:22:23.342 --> 00:22:26.587
When I do, I will stand tall and say

00:22:26.611 --> 00:22:30.411
that I am the first disciple of
Shibuya's Ran Kotobuki!

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:42.036
Daikirai anata itsumo waratte ite

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:48.227
Tsuyokute kawaikute ninki-mono de

00:22:48.667 --> 00:22:54.800
Daikirai watashi guzu de noroma de

00:22:55.040 --> 00:23:00.308
Dare ni mo hitsuyou to saretenai...

00:23:01.279 --> 00:23:07.562
Atama mo yokute itsumo suki ga nakute

00:23:07.586 --> 00:23:13.355
Watashi nado kitto baka ni sareteru

00:23:13.925 --> 00:23:20.241
Hontou wa hanashi-kakete-mitakute

00:23:20.265 --> 00:23:25.947
Tomodachi ni naritai to omottete

00:23:25.971 --> 00:23:31.933
Urayamashiku omotteta anata ga

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:37.892
Hitori kata furuwasete naite ita yo

00:23:37.916 --> 00:23:45.433
Nei anata mo hitori obieteru no?

00:23:45.457 --> 00:23:51.372
Minna mijime de yowai no kana

00:23:51.396 --> 00:23:58.079
Motto yuuki ga atta nara

00:23:58.103 --> 00:24:04.509
Watashi anata dakishimeteta

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.888
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.912 --> 00:24:08.589
Next Super GALS!
The sun is glaring, the cicadas are droning,

00:24:08.613 --> 00:24:09.657
Next Super GALS!
the eyes are burning, the heart is smoldering.

00:24:09.681 --> 00:24:10.191
The eyes are burning, the heart is smoldering.

00:24:10.215 --> 00:24:11.359
Revenge!

00:24:11.383 --> 00:24:14.095
Having had Ran stolen away from him
by Machida Black, Tatsukichi,

00:24:14.119 --> 00:24:15.897
Second Place's discomfort index is
currently at two hundred percent!

00:24:15.921 --> 00:24:17.231
Revenge!

00:24:17.255 --> 00:24:18.566
Second Place...

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:20.735
Now, there's going to be a snowboard battle
in the middle of summer for some reason!

00:24:20.759 --> 00:24:22.036
Will Second Place get his revenge?!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.305
Or with Tatsukichi turn
the tables on him?!

00:24:24.329 --> 00:24:26.240
Revenge!

